SQLite (https://sqlite.org) is compiled into Cabby for the SQLite broker: the
libsqlite3-sys crate bundles its C source (rusqlite's `bundled` feature; the
version is the one libsqlite3-sys pins in Cargo.lock). SQLite is in the public
domain (https://sqlite.org/copyright.html). Its source files carry this notice:

